              "text": "supplicium, suppliciī — \"punishment, execution; a prayer\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Prōditōrēs ad supplicium ductī sunt. The traitors were led to execution."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter. First a kneeling in prayer, then the kneeling of the condemned. Summum supplicium: the death penalty."
            }
          ]
        },
