              "text": "exsilium, exsiliī — \"exile, banishment\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Cōnsul in exsilium īre coāctus est. The consul was forced to go into exile."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter, also exilium. A Roman citizen could often choose exile before his trial ended. English exile."
            }
          ]
        },
